layerstack_schemas

The tables and views in `src/generated` are generated from the schema definitions of
OpenUSD 26.8 (the `generatedSchema.usda`, `plugInfo.json` and standard
`usdShaders/shaders/shaderDefs.usda` files of the
usd-core 26.8 wheel), which are distributed under the Tomorrow Open Source
Technology License 1.0; see `LICENSE-TOST-1.0`.

`src/gf/decomposition.rs` adapts OpenUSD's Gf matrix factorization,
orthogonalization and quaternion extraction under the same license.
`src/mass/diagonalize.rs` adapts OpenUSD's physics inertia diagonalization
and float matrix rotation extraction under the same license. OpenUSD's notice follows.
`src/light/helpers.rs` adapts OpenUSD's blackbody table and conversion
under the same license.

